@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:verification] date-display-source-parity
sync-mirrored-modules.cjs check mode MUST fail when a committed backend copy (date-display.ts, pdf-file-name.ts)
differs from its frontend source. Write mode MUST copy those sources without changing app packaging.

@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:testing] language-browser-isolation
ux/verify-language.cjs MUST use only loopback app URLs and synthetic API responses. A failed
visible-copy or date assertion MUST exit unsuccessfully without changing clinic data.

@cc [owner:nareshshah139,label:verification] contract-attachment-check
contracts/check-attachment.cjs MUST fail when any @cc directive in a supported source file is not
listed by cc-check list for that file, and MUST fail when cc-check itself errors on a file.
